      "bbox": {
        "l": 146.25,
        "t": 689.81625,
        "r": 521.0624999999998,
        "b": 662.99625
      },
      "content": "Pressing the Alarm silence/suspend switch temporarily silences alarms for the time indicated in the Silence Period."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0521",
      "reading_order": 566,
      "section": "Audible Alarm Type",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.0,
        "t": 649.5525,
        "r": 169.64100000000008,
        "b": 636.1875
      },
      "content": "Audible Alarm Type",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0522",
      "reading_order": 567,
      "section": "Audible Alarm Type",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 146.25,
        "t": 635.25375,
        "r": 257.8125,
        "b": 622.49625
      },
      "content": "GN924 or IEC60601-1-8"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0523",
      "reading_order": 568,
      "section": "Audible Alarm Type",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 146.25,
        "t": 621.75375,
        "r": 523.3127999999998,
        "b": 581.99625
      },
      "content": "The N5500 has two different audible alarm types, called GN924 and IEC60601-1-8. They have different tone pitch and on-off beep patterns. (Refer to Alarms and Limits section in the operator's manual)"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0524",
      "reading_order": 569,
      "section": "AC Line Frequency",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 72.0,
        "t": 568.5525,
        "r": 169.35799999999995,
        "b": 555.1875
      },
      "content": "AC Line Frequency",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0525",
      "reading_order": 570,
      "section": "AC Line Frequency",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 146.25,
        "t": 554.25375,
        "r": 213.5625,
        "b": 541.49625
      },
      "content": "50 Hz or 60Hz"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0526",
      "reading_order": 571,
      "section": "AC Line Frequency",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 146.25,
        "t": 540.75375,
        "r": 533.0607999999993,
        "b": 514.49625
      },
      "content": "The monitor is designed for supporting AC line frequency both 50 Hz and 60 Hz. Select either 50Hz or 60 Hz frequency for an appropriate AC line."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0527",
      "reading_order": 572,
      "section": "AC Line Frequency",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 146.25,
        "t": 486.75375,
        "r": 519.5627500000002,
        "b": 460.49625
      },
      "content": "The language selected will be used for all the text shown on the display; the selected language will be effective the next time the monitor is powered up."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0528",
      "reading_order": 573,
      "section": "AC Line Frequency",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 146.25,
        "t": 446.25375,
        "r": 521.8127499999999,
        "b": 419.99625
      },
      "content": "Note : If an unfamiliar language is chosen, the user may find it difficult to operate the monitor."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0529",
