    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0530",
      "reading_order": 576,
      "section": "NIBP Test Mode",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 146.25,
        "t": 391.5525,
        "r": 533.6245,
        "b": 351.1875
      },
      "content": "WARNING: A blood pressure cuff, connected to the monitor, should never be applied  to  a  human  subject  while  the  monitor is in  NIBP  test Mode, as injury could result."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0531",
      "reading_order": 577,
      "section": "NIBP Test Mode",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 146.25,
        "t": 335.25375,
        "r": 539.0642499999994,
        "b": 281.99625
      },
      "content": "NIBP Test  Mode  provides  to  facilitate  performing  verification  testing  for  the  NIBP subsystem. Typically, when  these  tests are performed, the pneumatic  system  is connected to an  NIBP simulator or a Rigid cuff can as a closed reference volume. For the detailed test procedures in this mode, refer to the Performance Test section."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0532",
      "reading_order": 578,
      "section": "NIBP Test Mode",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 146.25,
        "t": 267.7537500000001,
        "r": 538.6875000000001,
        "b": 241.49625000000003
      },
      "content": "The NIBP Tests are described in Table 10. When any of NIBP tests is initiated, 'Test in Progress' message will appears on the right of the top screen during the test."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0533",
      "reading_order": 579,
      "section": "NIBP Test Mode",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 146.25,
        "t": 227.25374999999997,
        "r": 538.4386000000003,
        "b": 187.49625000000003
      },
      "content": "In the NIBP Test Mode, no function switch will have no effect except the knob. All the tests  will  start  to  be  performed  by  pressing  or  rotating  the  knob.  If  you  would  like  to stop the test during test progressing, press the knob."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0534",
      "reading_order": 580,
      "section": "NIBP Test Mode",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 146.25,
        "t": 173.25374999999997,
        "r": 539.0625,
        "b": 146.99625000000003
      },
      "content": "Note: If any further NIBP test is not selected to be performed after a test is completed, a notice screen will display in approximately 10 minutes."
    },
